  "body": "[Element definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#dom-customelementsregistry-define), step 21 says:\n\n> Let _upgrade candidates_ be all elements in _document_ &hellip; in tree order.\n\nI think this means elements in shadow trees are not considered, but that sounds wrong. Perhaps tree order should be [shadow including tree order.](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-including-tree-order)\n",
